{"schemaVersion":1,"seq":9,"prev":"4d85305e0aae3a20cc9894c9224eb147e1427f7fc88084730e68675eff12a189","at":"2026-10-01T06:41:47.330629Z","type":"llm_call","state":"adjudicate","iter":0,"node":"adjudicate","data":{"kind":"adjudicate","model":"codex/gpt-5.6-sol","effort":"medium","index":0,"input_hash":"5b01ceb40339b5461871f8412d9d114aeee11a725995d91374e132d63ed728b3","verdict":{"reasoning":"The fallback is genuinely fail-open on systems where TMPDIR is shared (or unset, yielding /tmp). An attacker can pre-create the predictable stop-gate directory and state file; block_is_repeat reads attacker-controlled prev_total/prev_n before checking whether its write succeeds, so a planted high counter can make the next refusal satisfy the limit and exit successfully. Sticky-bit protection on /tmp does not prevent creating this child path first. The private cache and Git-directory fallbacks reduce exposure but do not eliminate the introduced vulnerability.","is_real":true,"confidence":0.98},"confidence":0.98,"tokens":{"input":21189,"cache_read":0,"cache_create":0,"output":125,"reasoning":234},"duration_ms":12072}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"seq":10,"prev":"fb97464975e7ff2c1e598c43717a3bfb89b603d78b0ebed5bb4576ddb3a219d8","at":"2026-10-01T06:42:01.339902Z","type":"llm_call","state":"adjudicate","iter":0,"node":"adjudicate","data":{"kind":"adjudicate","model":"codex/gpt-5.6-sol","effort":"medium","index":1,"input_hash":"48d9e9ee45a1373b82716b4405c31d149d1d1d409739c20e77a273ef68bb3a37","verdict":{"reasoning":"The code does key no-session state from HOST_CWD (then ORIG_PWD), so a changing value would produce a different key. However, the finding provides no evidence that any supported host changes its reported launch cwd between turns, making the alleged livelock conditional speculation rather than a demonstrated defect. The test-absence claim also cannot be confirmed from the supplied search record: only one of two relevant stophook_layout_test.go hunks is shown, while test-stop-hook.sh explicitly delegates guard-counting coverage to that omitted real-CLI coverage.","is_real":false,"confidence":0.91},"confidence":0.91,"tokens":{"input":8460,"cache_read":16256,"cache_create":0,"output":131,"reasoning":354},"duration_ms":11840,"claim_class":"testing-gap","claim_evidence":["internal/githooktest/stophook_layout_test.go","tests/go/test-stop-hook.sh","docs/specs/2026-08-31-pins-and-bug-class.md","docs/specs/2026-09-04-lights-out-sdlc-factory.md","docs/specs/2026-08-26-metareview-0.9.0-fsm-enhancements.md"]}}
